      "title": "uat: Minor updates",
      "message": "uat: Minor updates\n\nAdd PT_TXTMOD_DISSECTOR to the casees handled by uat_fld_tostr.\nReorder the cases to more closely match putfld, which uat_save\nuses.\n\nGet rid of an unnecessary strdup of a GString.\n\nuat_load_str dupes the string entry passed in, so that can be const.\n\nNote that uat_fld_tostr doesn't do what the documentation says,\nthough sharkd_session uses it as-is and puts the results in JSON\ninstead of the UAT CSV format.\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
